                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5ba40507-08fa-32ac-a777-be815be0aabe",
                        "entry_id": "f3443298-f64f-38fe-a82a-f2ea0961b2ed",
                        "glosses": [
                            "тот, кто симулирует, притворяясь больным, травмированным, сумасшедшим"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "89ad95d9-74ba-4db8-9f67-183c53e523b9",
                                "sense_id": "5ba40507-08fa-32ac-a777-be815be0aabe",
                                "text": "Очень часто симулирование бывает так грубо и так непохоже на то, что желательно изобразить, что оно очевидно для окружающих; это сразу понимает и сам симулянт, быстро бросающий притворство как средство, оказавшееся совершенно непригодным."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "36ac7ec8-37a2-4637-a8a8-3a80be08d1d5",
                        "source_entry_id": "f3443298-f64f-38fe-a82a-f2ea0961b2ed",
                        "source_sense_id": "5ba40507-08fa-32ac-a777-be815be0aabe",
                        "target_lang_word": "simulator",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "simulator",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "91a06e4f-2be8-39bb-8259-48d2b8b11a54",
                                        "entry_id": "5983c5bc-97eb-3934-b11e-3f3f976af729",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who simulates or feigns."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "193fecee-e117-4bac-a158-705a58dcb036",
                                                "sense_id": "91a06e4f-2be8-39bb-8259-48d2b8b11a54",
                                                "text": "Even confessing to a crime, the man may be mad, or a knavish simulator."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "112a661e-99d7-303c-9342-28fff5441934",
                                        "entry_id": "5983c5bc-97eb-3934-b11e-3f3f976af729",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A machine or system that simulates an environment (such as an aircraft cockpit), often for training purposes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af725404-b168-41d9-a20d-c3d18730ec5d",
                                                "sense_id": "112a661e-99d7-303c-9342-28fff5441934",
                                                "text": "The dummy rocket is being developed to permit the ground testing of missile controls. By the use of this “flight simulator” the control devices of missiles can be subjected to operational tests on the ground, thus reducing the need for expensive flight tests."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa5285f7-d58c-47af-a6c3-7c833a8deb4e",
                                                "sense_id": "112a661e-99d7-303c-9342-28fff5441934",
                                                "text": "Classroom sessions for drivers are under way, with each driver requiring a full day on the simulator before they then test a tram on the £350 million new line."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6bbd4293-56b4-3f4a-a3aa-b3addef27a27",
                                        "entry_id": "5983c5bc-97eb-3934-b11e-3f3f976af729",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A game that attempts to reproduce an experience realistically."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6dc7c09a-6625-4545-ac5b-fc99f268379b",
                                                "sense_id": "6bbd4293-56b4-3f4a-a3aa-b3addef27a27",
                                                "text": "a pinball simulator"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fcc21584-52ab-4a7d-a5b5-53f1b8d5f944",
                                                "sense_id": "6bbd4293-56b4-3f4a-a3aa-b3addef27a27",
                                                "text": "While writing for Mastertronic, David had seen that sales figures were much better for 'simulators' compared to less realistic games […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1d4f0c06-0c0c-478f-9fe8-98e1a390dce2",
                        "source_entry_id": "f3443298-f64f-38fe-a82a-f2ea0961b2ed",
                        "source_sense_id": "5ba40507-08fa-32ac-a777-be815be0aabe",
                        "target_lang_word": "simulant",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "simulant",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b0394dbc-eca4-352b-85b8-02d3cad583da",
                                        "entry_id": "49f6939a-bb80-3a25-a814-70f902366458",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that simulates something else such as a gemstone."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fff9ccfd-9c7d-43c5-9f1e-44c287c3ba87",
                                                "sense_id": "b0394dbc-eca4-352b-85b8-02d3cad583da",
                                                "text": "Due to its low cost and close visual likeness to diamond, cubic zirconia has remained the most gemologically and economically important diamond simulant since 1976."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb4bca12-f5d2-4523-a155-8e5b919f21eb",
                                                "sense_id": "b0394dbc-eca4-352b-85b8-02d3cad583da",
                                                "text": "He could invent a fictional restaurant for you to bite your burger at but any fictional restaurant would be, like Nomenex, a worthless simulant or inconcinne imitation, a placebic generic."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9a905707-92d0-4959-907a-327e1251e78e",
                                                "sense_id": "b0394dbc-eca4-352b-85b8-02d3cad583da",
                                                "text": "The soil sample, called LZS-1, is the latest in a list of lunar regolith simulants of varying quality that have been developed to help Nasa and other space agencies around the world prepare for missions to the Moon."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "simulant",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8677c50c-ac1a-38d1-ba77-9863d5aba328",
                                        "entry_id": "063be8e5-9840-34eb-9a3e-472e3ea0dc75",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Simulating, replacing, or having the form or appearance of something else."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "31460d2f-6cb1-4137-b58e-7117f1757fd2",
                        "source_entry_id": "f3443298-f64f-38fe-a82a-f2ea0961b2ed",
                        "source_sense_id": "5ba40507-08fa-32ac-a777-be815be0aabe",
                        "target_lang_word": "malingerer",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "malingerer",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b35576c6-ea82-3c61-ba7d-c76970354fe4",
                                        "entry_id": "cd0a4517-1c49-3aee-8f98-53e216b16894",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who malingers."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ffe21d44-4b16-4d24-baa0-f8bea204ffb8",
                                                "sense_id": "b35576c6-ea82-3c61-ba7d-c76970354fe4",
                                                "text": "It is telling, in this context of rising rates of mental illness, that New Labour committed itself, early in its third term in government, to removing people from Incapacity Benefit, implying that many, if not most, claimants are malingerers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "19bc3a7c-7e22-47ef-a834-95c31bfe6059",
                        "source_entry_id": "f3443298-f64f-38fe-a82a-f2ea0961b2ed",
                        "source_sense_id": "5ba40507-08fa-32ac-a777-be815be0aabe",
                        "target_lang_word": "simulador",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "simulador",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2f23e068-cbfb-311f-952f-3c04111b1404",
                                        "entry_id": "80c3c31c-ac85-3688-8561-5612bdb58c3b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Que simula o finge."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "noun"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef362c7c-93e3-4129-ad8b-809277577266",
                                                "sense_id": "2f23e068-cbfb-311f-952f-3c04111b1404",
                                                "text": "Vacíe el modelo en escayola para modelos utilizando material simulador de tejido blando para representar los contornos gingivales"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "simulador",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e36d28a4-b7a6-3664-a62a-a6fda105e438",
                                        "entry_id": "35a54030-d255-3317-a39c-c9ac1a0a4331",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Hombre que finge una enfermedad o condición por alguna razón psíquica."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c150aaa-4f00-44c5-8379-0321125df664",
                                                "sense_id": "e36d28a4-b7a6-3664-a62a-a6fda105e438",
                                                "text": "Los simuladores tienden a fingir los síntomas físicos o psicológicos, motivados por incentivos externos como no realizar el servicio militar, evitar un trabajo, obtener una compensación económica, escapar de una condena criminal u obtener drogas"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "simulador",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f94e75b2-15ad-314d-acc5-752fd5ba42bd",
                                        "entry_id": "a8778240-70d3-373c-bfe1-dbb9151dd828",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Aparato, por lo general informático, que permite la reproducción de un sistema. Los simuladores reproducen sensaciones y experiencias que en la realidad pueden llegar a suceder."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e2dcca3-9ebd-4008-8b3f-c2ab82e5e0e1",
                                                "sense_id": "f94e75b2-15ad-314d-acc5-752fd5ba42bd",
                                                "text": "En los simuladores de vuelo de mayor realismo las horas de entrenamiento contabilizan como horas de vuelo reales y capacitan al piloto para realizar su labor"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
